{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>iPhone 儲存空間又滿了？Cleanup &amp; Declutter Photos 針對早已遺忘的重複相片、巨型影片與堆積數月的截圖，一次掃描即可找出並清理，適合經常面對容量不足的用家。原價 US $0.99，現於 App Store <a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-130.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>全程本機掃描保障私隱</h2>\n<p>App 會以智能建議顯示可回收的儲存空間，並細分相片、影片、截圖與重複項目的容量。它能找出完全相同與近似重複的副本，自動保留最佳版本並一鍵智能合併；亦可按檔案大小揪出巨型影片，或按月份清理截圖。全部掃描於本機完成，刪除前必須由你確認。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-156-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-157-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-158-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-159-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-160-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-161-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Cleanup &amp; Declutter Photos</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/cleanup-declutter-photos/id6758605025?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.390722+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":316,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T04:20:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:17:27.399696+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:38.107596+00:00","content_hash":"402e5850b164b5385360ad58241b93825c6f2ee280688b380fdc906088a160cb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}